Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.00,0:00:05.20,TitleCard,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}用愛點亮星空
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:04.20,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}Peace and love
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.20,0:00:08.20,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}溫暖的風吹散了迷霧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.50,0:00:13.80,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}愛在心底慢慢的復甦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.50,0:00:18.20,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}Mmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.20,0:00:23.00,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}窗外下著雨 城市太過擁擠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.00,0:00:25.50,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}我們都忘了該怎麼去呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.50,0:00:27.50,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}收起那些帶刺的防備和懷疑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.60,0:00:31.00,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}能不能試著用真心去拉近距離
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:34.20,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}不需要言語 眼神就夠傳遞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.50,0:00:36.50,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}這世界其實沒想像中那麼挑剔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.50,0:00:38.90,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}把心打開讓愛意慢慢的累積
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.90,0:00:41.50,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}你會發現幸福其實沒那麼神秘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.50,0:00:44.20,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}聽 這是心跳的聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.20,0:00:46.80,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}多麼純粹 多麼的堅定
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.80,0:00:49.40,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}當所有喧囂都歸於平靜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:52.00,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}只有愛是最美的風景
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.80,0:00:55.00,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}Peace and love 讓愛包圍這世界
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.00,0:00:58.00,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}抹去眼淚 告別所有的傷悲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:01.80,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}用最溫柔的擁抱 融化所有冰雪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.80,0:01:06.50,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}我們的愛 永不熄滅
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.00,0:01:11.50,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}Peace and love 手牽手走向明天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.50,0:01:16.50,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}每一個微笑 都是最美的誓言
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.50,0:01:20.50,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}讓這首歌傳遍世界的每一個角落
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:27.00,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}用愛 用愛點亮星空
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.00,0:01:30.00,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}走在街上看著人來人往
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:32.20,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}每個人臉上似乎都有相同的迷惘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.20,0:01:34.50,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}生活太過急促 腳步太過匆忙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.50,0:01:37.00,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}我們是不是忘了當初純真的模樣
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.00,0:01:39.50,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}Hey, stop it for a second, let it breathe
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.50,0:01:42.00,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}這世界需要更多的溫暖善意
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.00,0:01:44.20,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}放下爭吵 放下那些無謂的執著
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.20,0:01:46.50,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}用愛去包容才是最完美的解脫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.50,0:01:49.20,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}Look around, the sun is shining so bright
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.20,0:01:51.50,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}不要讓愁雲遮蔽了你的光彩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.50,0:01:54.00,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}伸出你的手 傳遞一份愛的能量
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.00,0:01:56.50,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}這世界終將因你而變得不一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.50,0:01:59.50,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}Peace and love 讓愛包圍這世界
