Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.00,0:02:36.50,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}當黑夜降臨 繁星點點 (Peace and love)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.80,0:02:41.20,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}愛的故事還在繼續蔓延
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.20,0:02:44.80,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}只要心中還有光亮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.80,0:02:51.00,LyricMain,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)}我們就永遠不會迷失方向
